  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "lhe_line_01",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker_id": "protagonist",
      "expression": "concerned",
      "outfit": "default",
      "text": "丁十七下四的回执已经连续十一年变化，纸票和船内影像也指向一个正在长大的孩子。先不用让他重复证明自己是人，我们把依附项暂停为财物归类，按能被保护的自然人开临时伤页。",
      "next": "lhe_line_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "lhe_line_02",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker_id": "lu_he",
      "expression": "guarded",
      "outfit": "cold_storage_child",
      "text": "我听见有人在柜外。怕黑的时候我会敲三短、四长、一下停顿，妈妈说你们听见就会回我。别把我的票放回她的账里，我想有自己的名字。",
      "next": "lhe_choice_01"
    },
    {
      "id": "lhe_choice_01",
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "lhe_choice_separate_identity",
          "text": "把陆禾从母亲账户的依附栏移入待核姓名册，保留他的节律、纸票与船内影像；七十二小时内补一项独立核验，不把期限届满写成默认放弃。",
          "next": "lhe_effect_01",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "relation_delta", "character_id": "lu_he", "stat": "trust", "delta": 2},
            {"type": "set_flag", "flag": "lu_he_independent_identity_opened", "value": true}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "lhe_choice_keep_dependency_for_now",
          "text": "先维持母子账户的最低保温与药量，暂不公开陆禾的姓名；同时单独封存节律和影像，等母亲与船内见证补证后再改栏。",
          "next": "lhe_effect_01",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "relation_delta", "character_id": "lu_he", "stat": "respect", "delta": 1},
            {"type": "set_flag", "flag": "lu_he_dependency_protected", "value": true}
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lhe_effect_01",
      "type": "effect",
      "effects": [
        {"type": "set_flag", "flag": "lu_he_natural_person_boundary_preserved", "value": true},
        {"type": "character_expression", "character_id": "lu_he", "expression": "relieved"}
      ],
      "next": "lhe_end"
